{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8001_p", "source_sha256": "e4c77db1fcd3c6853395bc4a71e3835134b5ecd3ecd7caaa9f9a8548495df626", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n企画。可奈は『舞姫衣装』を着ての撮影だ）", "zh": "（今天是为偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍摄写真企划。可奈要穿着“舞姬服装”进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8002_036kan", "source_sha256": "f11a0908507726a258eb02b568d41b520ab0b497a0effb093d02a3231d833cb9", "ja": "わーいわーい！　かわいい水着で撮影だ～♪\nこれから撮影、楽しみだ～。えへっ♪", "zh": "太好啦太好啦！能穿着可爱的泳装拍摄啦～♪\n接下来的拍摄好期待哦～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8003_p", "source_sha256": "ee45c0f135283e3e5698603fc949f8b1673baf467f62c98286e9440de053a790", "ja": "ははっ、よかった。\n衣装、気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，太好了。\n看来你很喜欢这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8004_036kan", "source_sha256": "def0a365c45d96473edc2b2f85cd5889c159e33882fea40d6eedcb210cd1e209", "ja": "はい！　着てると、不思議な力が湧いてくるみたいで。\nなんだか落ち着かないっていうか……。", "zh": "是的！穿上之后，好像就会涌出一股不可思议的力量。\n该怎么说呢……总觉得有点静不下心来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8005_p", "source_sha256": "bcdbe60867e2dd2dfe409b4a1e604a13e509a0a3b85a2711f9a3afd5f871b728", "ja": "まあ、そういうこともあるかもしれないな。\n衣装を着ると、スイッチが入るって人もいるし。", "zh": "倒也确实可能会有这种情况呢。\n毕竟也有人一穿上演出服，就会开启状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8006_036kan", "source_sha256": "9ea55e96ae921482b98ed00ba6137488c6dd740600c2a1272f337fa65391fce1", "ja": "そうなんですね。この衣装も、\n何か不思議な力が隠れてるのかもしれませんね！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。这套服装里，说不定也隐藏着某种不可思议的力量呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8007_036kan", "source_sha256": "49d92e25c65f817dcbcde4ba8e0610e1dd37f696e7e0625347255e6f98dc14e1", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどんな力だと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得，\n会是什么样的力量呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8008", "source_sha256": "3bc5149ecf7527ad801beec67e3e510e2cfdeac951197cfd828786d10b53d58d", "ja": "踊りがうまくなる", "zh": "舞跳得更好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8009", "source_sha256": "8a44f2fb08f087aa703d2e329fd1c633c0ab1adcb0f2225aba7f9d6788e5bbd0", "ja": "歌がうまくなる", "zh": "歌唱水平提高", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8010", "source_sha256": "615b87337c00ba07ac53bf5e47a20a151bc9fdddf58a9bd14f95a766125a8cc6", "ja": "足が速くなる", "zh": "跑得更快", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8100_p", "source_sha256": "14d86a297cc1bbe4c66fe9f3f224f76d35007f67459be87209724a11588d4d0c", "ja": "そうだな……。舞姫らしく、\n上手に踊れるようになるかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊……说不定能像舞姬一样，跳得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8101_036kan", "source_sha256": "3b0c54d3ab3d0c9abecca886829e67351e1a1a3835a26c21b233757b12776c63", "ja": "踊りが……うまく！　わあ、カッコいい～！\nそれじゃ、やってみます！　……えーいっ！", "zh": "跳舞……变得厉害了！哇，好帅气～！那我来试试看！……嘿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8102_036kan", "source_sha256": "d33016f9aaaedeb1c9c3306e9622f9c3482b07c647a3751d75b47600201c2ac3", "ja": "……すごいすごい！　いつもよりうまく踊れました！\n衣装の力で、撮影がんばるぞ～♪　おーっ！", "zh": "……好厉害好厉害！跳得比平时还要好呢！\n借着服装的力量，拍摄要加油啦～♪噢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8200_p", "source_sha256": "c460d1a229b6e329ae94bd3aabba04049bf80d73cdf883a50fb4c64e50b1dbe7", "ja": "うーん……\nもしかしたら、歌がもっとうまくなる……とか？", "zh": "嗯……\n难道说，歌唱也能变得更厉害……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8201_036kan", "source_sha256": "6586815ae83448d9e579f5c6cf83c3f55c9b298c5b88d7b2cf17d99fc959d074", "ja": "本当ですか！？　じゃあ今の気持ちを歌ってみます！\nららら～♪　ら～ら～ら～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？那我就试着把现在的心情唱出来！\n啦啦啦～♪ 啦～啦～啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8202_036kan", "source_sha256": "58b0c1e9786dac712de45a6859937e9c315b6921a6ab3b6c62c8907e3b344c0c", "ja": "わあっ！　いつもより調子がいいです！\nこの水着のおかげだー！", "zh": "哇！状态比平时还好！\n都是这件泳装的功劳——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8300_p", "source_sha256": "f609b3f3ebba2439fda1b101ccc5c93d03cbbdc8acab06330f84acdb5b663d92", "ja": "不思議な力っていうくらいだ。身体能力が\n向上してるかも。例えば、足が速くなったとか……。", "zh": "都可以称得上是不可思议的力量了。身体能力\n说不定有所提升。比如说，跑得更快了之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8301_036kan", "source_sha256": "6b46284f00cbe39e71fa2ee1b5a5bf0a9287f06d4b4c5aff2baad4dde6280e2b", "ja": "わわっ！　言われてみればそんな気がしてきました！\n私、ちょっと走ってきます！", "zh": "哇哇！你这么一说，我也觉得好像确实是这样！\n我这就去跑一圈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_8303_036kan", "source_sha256": "b839c285ddaeb12873492cc33e7afd25a89ebf5d121210a610696dae033ce17c", "ja": "ぜえ、はぁ、ぜえ、はぁ……。\n全然速くなってないじゃないですか～！", "zh": "呼……哈……呼……哈……  \n不是完全没变快嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
